{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09572","headline":"青山峡口泊舟怀狄侍御 · 岑参","name":"青山峡口泊舟怀狄侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峡口秋水壮，沙边且停桡。\n奔涛振石壁，峰势如动摇。\n九月芦花新，弥令客心焦。\n谁念在江岛，故人满天朝。\n无处豁心胸，忧来醉能销。\n往来巴山道，三见秋草雕。\n狄生新相知，才调凌云霄。\n赋诗析造化，入幕生风飙。\n把笔判甲兵，战士不敢骄。\n皆云梁公後，遇鼎还能调。\n离别倏经时，音尘殊寂寥。\n何当见夫子，不叹乡关遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}